WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.967
Every change is saved on this device automatically as you work.

2
00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:05.349
“Data & safety”

3
00:00:05.349 --> 00:00:08.216
shows where your data is and how it is protected,

4
00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:10.619
and keeps automatic recovery copies:

5
00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:15.693
one every twelve hours when something changed, the newest seven.

6
00:00:16.793 --> 00:00:19.486
A backup file is your copy outside the device:

7
00:00:19.788 --> 00:00:23.421
keep one every week on a USB stick or a cloud folder,

8
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.357
preferably encrypted, with a password of at least ten characters.

9
00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.935
Every restore is validated and previewed,

10
00:00:29.994 --> 00:00:32.315
and a snapshot is taken before it.

11
00:00:33.415 --> 00:00:36.247
In “Security”, press “Turn on encryption”

12
00:00:36.271 --> 00:00:37.884
and choose a long passphrase.

13
00:00:38.187 --> 00:00:40.821
Records, snapshots and files are encrypted,

14
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.317
and the keys never leave the device.

15
00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:46.274
You also get a recovery key:

16
00:00:46.298 --> 00:00:49.803
if you forget your passphrase, it is the only way back in,

17
00:00:49.862 --> 00:00:52.160
and AVRASTRO cannot recover it for you.

18
00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:54.900
Print it or keep it in a password manager.

19
00:00:55.145 --> 00:00:59.196
If both are lost, the data on the device cannot be opened.

20
00:01:00.296 --> 00:01:03.186
Set an automatic lock, and press “Lock now”

21
00:01:03.187 --> 00:01:04.347
when you step away.

22
00:01:04.812 --> 00:01:05.880
The “Audit log”

23
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.571
records who, what and when, with the previous and new value.

24
00:01:09.758 --> 00:01:12.961
And with sync you work offline on every device;

25
00:01:13.264 --> 00:01:16.328
changes merge safely when you are back online.

26
00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:20.097
That covers the basics of AVRASTRO CRM.

27
00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:22.234
Without internet everything works;

28
00:01:22.478 --> 00:01:25.809
only sign-in, sync, the website inbox,

29
00:01:25.903 --> 00:01:28.816
the client portal and AI drafts need a connection.
